  "function": "Monitoring record deletion",
  "harm": "Delay in diagnosis due to unavailable monitoring history",
  "severity": "Moderate"
}
```

Output:

```json
{
  "code": "H1",
  "dimension": "Hazard Record Completeness and Semantic Integrity",
  "verdict": "No",
  "rationale": "The hazardous situation is described as a deletion confirmation control rather than the exposure circumstance in which needed monitoring history is unavailable for clinical review.",
  "cited_req_ids": [],
  "cited_test_case_ids": [],
  "unblocked_items": ["hazardous_situation"]
}
```

